### [the coil floor](at_coil)
---
Relic: cipher
Point: 883, -900, 2083
Roles: cipher_coil
---
Out in the shell of the room, not just off the core. A point 20u clear of a mass is not
clear of it - a hull is wider than that - so a marker has to sit where a SHIP fits, which
is a different question from whether the maths says it is outside.

